<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Event Registration Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background-color: #0093EB; color: white; padding: 10px; text-align: center; }
        .content { background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 20px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #0093EB; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Event Successfully Registered</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{eventManagerName}},</p>
            <p>Your event <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> has been successfully registered. Below are the event details:</p>
            <h2>Event Details:</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Title:</strong> {{eventName}}</li>
                <li><strong>Date:</strong> {{eventDate}}</li>
                {{#if eventTime}}
                <li><strong>Time:</strong> {{eventTime}}</li>
                {{/if}}
                {{#if eventLocation}}
                <li><strong>Location:</strong> {{eventLocation}}</li>
                {{/if}}
             </ul>
            <p>If you need to make changes or have any questions, please use the event management panel or contact our support team.</p>
            <p>Thank you for choosing our platform to organize your event!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
